# DiabetesCare AI — Cursor Rules

## GitHub organization

- **Organization:** `dkg-diabetescare-ai` (not `diabetescare-ai`)
- **Research repo:** https://github.com/dkg-diabetescare-ai/diabetescare-ai
- When linking issues, PRs, or clone URLs, always use `github.com/dkg-diabetescare-ai/`

## Project

IIT Kharagpur research (6 weeks): AI for diabetic foot wounds, periwound skin, and eye contributing factors.

