## Related repos (separate from this org)

- Mobile app: `HealthScreenApp` (React Native)
- Clinical API: `HealthScreeningApp/backend` (Flask) — integrates at session submit
- Do not commit `data/` or `models/`; weights stay gitignored

## Git workflow

- Branches: `feature/`, `bugfix/`, `docs/`, `refactor/`, `test/`
- Commit tags: `[FEATURE]`, `[BUGFIX]`, `[DOCS]`, `[TEST]`, `[REFACTOR]`
- Run `black` and `flake8` before push; `pytest tests/ cv/tests/`
- PRs: request review from Prof. Dipak Kumar Das

## Code standards

- Python: PEP 8, type hints, docstrings on public functions
- Snake_case files and functions
- New code requires tests under `tests/` or `cv/tests/`

## API alignment

Inference endpoints in `backend/api/` should match product session submit contracts documented in `docs/API_CONTRACT.md` (when added).
